BOOKED row     -> active_slot = appt_datetime -> duplicates REJECTED (ERROR 1062)
CANCELLED row  -> active_slot = NULL          -> NULLs never collide, so the
                  cancelled record is KEPT and the slot is free to book again
'''
}

